    "if the CDP command is unavailable the tool records safe_area:'unavailable' and the safe-area bullet is a proposal until Mobile 15, with the checkable pass condition that every fixed or absolute control rule uses env(safe-area-inset-*)",
    "hiding the closed sheet changes what the inventory saw of it: it leaked 26 px (iphone13) and 7 px (pixel7) into view, so its Close button counted as an on-screen control at the bottom edge and its strip as chrome; the iphone13 controls inventory changes accordingly (now the open sheet's button) and none of chrome_cover may grow",
